      "preview": "דָּקַק: esmagar, pulverizar, debulhar; ser fino.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">דָּקַק</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: esmagar, pulverizar, debulhar; ser fino (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">دَقَّ</span> <em>ser</em> ou <em>tornar-se delgado, diminuto;</em> etíope ደቀቀ assírio <em>daḳâḳu</em> Pa. <em>quebrar em pedaços</em> COT<sup>Gloss</sup>; fenício <span dir=\"rtl\">דק</span> <em>idem</em>, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּקֵּק</span> Pa. <em>idem</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܕܰܩ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito, 3.ª pessoa do singular masculino <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.21\">Dt 9:21</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:20\" href=\"/Exodus.32.20\">Ex 32:20</a>; imperfeito, 3.ª pessoa do singular masculino com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">יְדֻקֶּ֑נּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.28\">Is 28:28</a>; 2.ª pessoa do singular masculino <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּדֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.15\">Is 41:15</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>esmagar</em> (transitivo) seguido de acusativo <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם</span> <em>cereal para pão, grão</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.28\">Is 28:28</a>; acerca da debulha ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.15\">Is 41:15</a> (figurado, da pulverização de montes) <strong>2.</strong>  somente no perfeito; <em>ser fino</em>, do estado a que Moisés reduziu o bezerro de ouro mediante trituração <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּטְחַן עַד אֲשֶׁר־דָּ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:20\" href=\"/Exodus.32.20\">Ex 32:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶכֹּת אֹתוֹ טָחוֹן הֵיטֵב עַד אֲשֶׁר־דַּק לְעָפָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.21\">Dt 9:21</a>.<br><strong>Hifil</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵדַק</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.15\">2 K 23:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.4\">2 Ch 34:4</a>; 2.ª pessoa do singular feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">וַהֲדִקּוֹת</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:13\" href=\"/Micah.4.13\">Mi 4:13</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫דֶק</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.6\">2 K 23:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.16\">2 Ch 15:16</a>; 1.ª pessoa do singular com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדִקֵּם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:43\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.43\">2 S 22:43</a> (mas <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרִיקֵם</span> ‖ <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:43\" href=\"/Psalms.18.43\">ψ 18:43</a>); infinitivo absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">הָדֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:36\" href=\"/Exodus.30.36\">Ex 30:36</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהֵדַק</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.7\">2 Ch 34:7</a> (forma anômala, cf. Ew<sup>§ 238 d</sup> Ol<sup>§ 258 b</sup> Be; leia-se talvez <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהָדֵק</span> Ki; ou <span dir=\"rtl\">לָדַק</span> [v. <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּדַּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.15\">Is 40:15</a>] cf. Öt);—<em>reduzir a pó, pulverizar</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫דֶק לְעָפָר</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.6\">2 K 23:6</a> (isto é, a aserá), ‖ <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.4\">2 Ch 34:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.7\">7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(כִּתַּת לְהֵדַק)</span>; assim acerca da <em>bamah</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵדַק לְעָפָר</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.15\">2 K 23:15</a>; acerca de <span dir=\"rtl\">מִפְלֶצֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.16\">2 Ch 15:16</a>; figurado <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:13\" href=\"/Micah.4.13\">Mi 4:13</a> (objeto <span dir=\"rtl\">עַמִּים רַבִּים</span>); <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:36\" href=\"/Exodus.30.36\">Ex 30:36</a> (P) tem <span dir=\"rtl\">וְשָׁחַקְתָּ֫ מִמֶּנָּה הָדֵק</span> <em>e triturarás uma parte dele até ficar fina</em> isto é, o incenso); <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:43\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.43\">2 S 22:43</a> leia-se <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרִיקֵם</span> (‖ <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:43\" href=\"/Psalms.18.43\">ψ 18:43</a>) em lugar de <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדִקֵּם</span> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, רִיק\" href=\"/BDB,_רִיק\", dir=\"rtl\">ריק</a>).<br><strong>Hofal</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יוּדָ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.28\">Is 28:28</a> <em>ser esmagado</em>, sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם</span> <em>cereal para pão</em> (cf. acima <strong>Qal</strong>);—sobre o sentido cf. Che Di.",
