      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דָּרוֹם</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino: sul</strong> (poético e tardio) <strong>(</strong>sobre a formação cf. Ol<sup>§ 216 a</sup> Sta<sup>§ 295</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">דָּרוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 37:17\" href=\"/Job.37.17\">Jb 37:17</a> + <strong>16 vezes</strong> + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.27\">Ez 40:27</a> b. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.28\">28</a> b (suprima-se 𝔖 Co no v. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.27\">27</a> b; AB 𝔖 Co no v. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.28\">28</a> b—<em>sul</em>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.18\">Ez 42:18</a> (em oposição a <span dir=\"rtl\">קָדִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צָפוֹן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יָם</span>); mais 12 vezes em Ezequiel) das quais Co suprime 2, cf. acima.) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.2\">21:2</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּימָנָה</span> e <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶגֶב</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּרֶךְ הַדּ׳</span> <em>em direção ao sul</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.24\">40:24</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.27\">27</a>, leia-se também <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּרֶךְ הַדּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.10\">42:10</a> em lugar de <span dir=\"rtl\">ד׳ הַקָּדִים</span> 𝔊 Ke Co; <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁעַר הַדּ׳</span> <em>porta do sul</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.27\">40:[27]</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.28\">28</a>, [<a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.28\">28</a>] cf. Co acima, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:44\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.44\">40:44</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">צפון</span>; também <span dir=\"rtl\">קדים</span>), v. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:45\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.45\">45</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">צפון</span>) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.12\">42:12</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">לַדָּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.11\">41:11</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">צפון</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">לִשְׁכוֹת הד׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.13\">42:13</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">צפון</span>). Em outros lugares somente <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.23\">Dt 33:23</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יַם</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 37:17\" href=\"/Job.37.17\">Jb 37:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 1:6\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.1.6\">Ec 1:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 11:3\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.11.3\">11:3</a> (ambos opostos a <span dir=\"rtl\">צפון</span>).",
