      "preview": "דָּשָׁא: brotar, germinar, verdejar.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">דָּשָׁא</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: brotar, germinar, verdejar (</strong>assírio <em>dišû</em> Pi <em>tornar abundante</em> Lyon <sup>Sargontexte 77</sup>; cf. também sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, דֶּ֫שֶׁא\" href=\"/BDB,_דֶּ֫שֶׁא\", dir=\"rtl\">דֶּשֶׁא</a>, donde, segundo outros, verbo denominativo.<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּֽשְׁאוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:22\" href=\"/Joel.2.22\">Jo 2:22</a> (sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">נְאוֹת מִדְבָּר</span>).<br><strong>Hifil</strong>  imperfeito, 3.ª pessoa do singular feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּדְשֵׁא</span> (jussivo) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:11\" href=\"/Genesis.1.11\">Gn 1:11</a> <em>fazer brotar</em> ou <em>germinar</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּדְשֵׁא הָאָרֶץ דֶּשֶׁא</span>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">דָּשָׁא</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.11\">Je 50:11</a> v. sob <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, דּוּשׁ\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_דּוּשׁ\">דּוּשׁ</a>.",
