      "preview": "דָּשֵׁן: ser gordo, engordar; retirar cinzas gordurosas.",
      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">דָּשֵׁן</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo: ser gordo, engordar (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">دَسِمَ</span>; donde também <span dir=\"rtl\">دَسَمٌ</span> <em>graxa, gordura;</em> hebraico pós-bíblico <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּשֵּׁן</span> <em>engordar</em>, cf. hebraico pós-bíblico <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּשֶׁן</span> <em>gordo</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito, 3.ª pessoa do singular masculino <span dir=\"rtl\">וְדָשֵׁן</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.20\">Dt 31:20</a> (JE) figurado, da prosperidade de Israel.<br><strong>Piel</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּשַּׁנְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 23:5\" href=\"/Psalms.23.5\">ψ 23:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְדִשְּׁנוּ</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:13\" href=\"/Numbers.4.13\">Nu 4:13</a>; imperfeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">יְדַשְּׁנֶה־סֶּֽלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 20:4\" href=\"/Psalms.20.4\">ψ 20:4</a> volitivo (cf. Ges<sup>§ 48, 3</sup> De; mas talvez se leia com sufixo -<span dir=\"rtl\">נֶהָ</span>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">נָהּ</span> v. Ki Ges<sup>l.c.</sup>); 3.ª pessoa do singular feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּדַשֶּׁן־</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.30\">Pr 15:30</a>; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">לְדַשְּׁנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:3\" href=\"/Exodus.27.3\">Ex 27:3</a>—causativo, <em>engordar</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ד׳ בשׁמן ראשׁי</span> isto é, ungir, símbolo de festividade e alegria <a data-ref=\"Psalms 23:5\" href=\"/Psalms.23.5\">ψ 23:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ד׳ עָ֑צֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.30\">Pr 15:30</a> do efeito corporal de boas notícias; <span dir=\"rtl\">ד׳ עולה</span> <em>achar</em> um holocausto <em>gordo</em> = aceitável <a data-ref=\"Psalms 20:4\" href=\"/Psalms.20.4\">ψ 20:4</a>; em outros lugares <em>denominativo</em> de <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּשֶׁן</span> (cinzas gordurosas);—<em>tirar, remover as cinzas gordurosas</em> (acusativo do altar limpo) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:13\" href=\"/Numbers.4.13\">Nu 4:13</a> (P), assim <span dir=\"rtl\">סירות לְדַשְּׁנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:3\" href=\"/Exodus.27.3\">Ex 27:3</a> (P).<br><strong>Pual</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יְדֻשָּׁ֑ן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.25\">Pr 28:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.7\">Is 34:7</a>; 3.ª pessoa do singular feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּדֻשָּׁן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.25\">Pr 11:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.4\">13:4</a>—passivo do Piel causativo, <em>ser engordado</em>, de pó saturado <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵחֵלֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.7\">Is 34:7</a>; figurado, da prosperidade do generoso <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.25\">Pr 11:25</a>, do diligente <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.4\">13:4</a>, daquele que confia <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.25\">28:25</a>.<br><strong>Hotpael</strong>  perfeito, 3.ª pessoa do singular feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">הֻדַּ֫שְׁנָה</span> (cf. Ol<sup>§ 271</sup> Ges<sup>§ 54, 3</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.6\">Is 34:6</a>, da espada de Yahweh:—<em>engordou a si mesma</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵחֶלֶב</span> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מָֽלְאָה דָּם</span>).",
