      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּ֫שֶׁן</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino: gordura, cinzas gordurosas</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ד׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 63:6\" href=\"/Psalms.63.6\">ψ 63:6</a> + 8 vezes, <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּ֑שֶׁן</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.16\">Lv 1:16</a> + 3 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּשֶׁן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 36:9\" href=\"/Psalms.36.9\">ψ 36:9</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּשְׁנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:9\" href=\"/Judges.9.9\">Ju 9:9</a>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>gordura</em>, abundância, exuberância, azeite, <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:9\" href=\"/Judges.9.9\">Ju 9:9</a> (da oliveira); abundância, fertilidade <a data-ref=\"Psalms 63:6\" href=\"/Psalms.63.6\">ψ 63:5</a> (em símile ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵלֶב</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:12\" href=\"/Psalms.65.12\">65:12</a>, de comida e bebida, <a data-ref=\"Job 36:16\" href=\"/Job.36.16\">Jb 36:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.14\">Je 31:14</a>; passando ao sentido figurado de bênção espiritual <a data-ref=\"Psalms 36:9\" href=\"/Psalms.36.9\">ψ 36:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(ד׳ ביתך)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.2\">Is 55:2</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>cinzas gordurosas</em>, isto é, cinzas das vítimas sacrificiais, misturadas com a gordura <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.16\">Lv 1:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.12\">4:12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.3\">6:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.4\">4</a> (todos P) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:40\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.40\">Je 31:40</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.3\">1 Ki 13:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.5\">5</a>.",
