      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דָּשֵׁן</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo: gordo</strong>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּשֵׁן</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.23\">Is 30:23</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁמֵן</span>), de <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם</span> como produto do solo; figurado, dos justos como árvores <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּשֵׁנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:15\" href=\"/Psalms.92.15\">ψ 92:15</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רעננים</span>) gordos, cheios de óleo (?) ou seiva (Che; cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, דֶּ֫שֶׁן\" href=\"/BDB,_דֶּ֫שֶׁן\", dir=\"rtl\">דֶּשֶׁן</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:9\" href=\"/Judges.9.9\">Ju 9:9</a>); como substantivo <em>vigorosos, robustos</em> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹרְדֵי עָפָר</span> cf. Che) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:30\" href=\"/Psalms.22.30\">ψ 22:30</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּשְׁנֵי־ אֶרֶץ</span> (Brüll <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁכְנֵי</span>, Renan<sup>Hist. iii. 134</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">ישְׁבֵי</span>).",
